    <mml:math display="inline" xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mml:mi>n</mml:mi></mml:math></alternatives></inline-formula> the number of participants.</p>
  </caption>
  <table id="tblGroups">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th align="left">Group</th>
        <th align="right">n</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
